% ATL-PHYS-PUB-2016-023 fig_03b: q qbar -> g* -> t tbar, an off-shell Higgs from one top line splitting to HH
layout: v2
in: q1 q2
out: t1 h1 h2 t2
q2 [q] -- [fermion] v -- [fermion] q1 [q]
v -- [gluon, label=g] w
t1 [t] -- [anti fermion] w -- [anti fermion] b -- [anti fermion] t2 [t]
b -- [ghost] x [dot]
x -- [ghost] h1 [H]
x -- [ghost] h2 [H]
